WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.685 --> 00:00:04.010
Ico and the Trial by Smoke

2
00:00:04.605 --> 00:00:07.050
Ico lived in ancient Lanzarote.

3
00:00:07.645 --> 00:00:10.050
She was the daughter of Zonzamas and
Fayna.

4
00:00:10.765 --> 00:00:16.445
Some members of the council distrusted her
because her skin was lighter, and they

5
00:00:16.445 --> 00:00:18.830
decided to put her on the test.

6
00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:25.250
They prepared a room where green branches
would be burnt to fill it with smoke.

7
00:00:25.905 --> 00:00:29.630
An old woman knew that this decision was
unfair.

8
00:00:30.685 --> 00:00:36.310
Before the test, she gave Ico a wet sponge
and explained how to breathe through it.

9
00:00:36.965 --> 00:00:43.330
Ico put the sponge away and thought: “The
truth does not need an unfair test.”

10
00:00:44.145 --> 00:00:46.810
The smoke began to fill the room.

11
00:00:47.485 --> 00:00:53.070
Ico crouched down, covered her mouth with
the damp sponge and waited.

12
00:00:53.725 --> 00:00:56.825
When they opened the door, she walked out.

13
00:00:56.825 --> 00:01:02.270
The council then recognised her place in
the family line.

14
00:01:02.525 --> 00:01:09.890
Ico thanked the old woman for her help,
but she did not celebrate the test.

15
00:01:10.405 --> 00:01:17.085
She looked at those who had judged her and
asked why anyone should have to put

16
00:01:17.085 --> 00:01:20.205
themselves in danger to prove who they
were.

17
00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:23.550
No one knew how to answer.

18
00:01:24.385 --> 00:01:32.045
Intelligence and solidarity had saved Ico,
but her question stayed in the island’s

19
00:01:32.045 --> 00:01:33.045
memory.

20
00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:41.065
Since then, whenever her story is told,
many voices repeat: “The truth does not

21
00:01:41.065 --> 00:01:43.490
need an unfair test.”

